  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de apoyo al fortalecimiento del sector tur&#xed;stico en El Salvador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Program for Strengthening the Tourism Sector in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es apoyar el fortalecimiento del sector tur&#xed;stico en El Salvador para maximizar su contribuci&#xf3;n socioecon&#xf3;mica al pa&#xed;s. Los objetivos espec&#xed;ficos son: (i) aumentar el n&#xfa;mero de visitantes internacionales y su gasto tur&#xed;stico (total y per c&#xe1;pita), (ii) la creaci&#xf3;n de empleo y actividad econ&#xf3;mica con aumento de inversi&#xf3;n; e (iii) incrementar la competitividad del pa&#xed;s como destino y la gesti&#xf3;n sostenible del sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to support the strengthening of the tourism sector in El Salvador to maximize its socioeconomic contribution to the country. The specific objectives are: (i) to increase the number of international visitors and their tourism spending (total and per capita), (ii) the creation of employment and economic activity through increased investment; and (iii) to enhance the country&apos;s competitiveness as a destination and the sustainable management of the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
